{
  "_about": "Providers and models the agent can use. The active one is chosen in .env (LLM_PROVIDER, LLM_MODEL). To add a model: add an entry under 'models', then run scripts/probe_settings.py to write its capability file. rpm/rpd = requests per minute/day (null = no known limit; the probe then paces at DEFAULT_RPM). key_env null = no key needed (local Ollama). local = runs on this machine through Ollama (ollama pull <model>).",
